Changelog:
- The Boss' sprite has been improved;
- Minor bug fixed;

- [u]On PLUS! edition some BGM have been rearranged and we added [b]two new achievements![/b][/u] Check them out :)

Changelog:
- Added SETTINGS and HIGHSCORES pages to the main launcher;
- Now with stardard keymap setting, you have N as jump and M as fire to improve compatibility with as much systems as possible;
- Minor bugfix;

Also, we added some easter eggs here and there,,, let's see if you can find them :)

Changelog:

- "GAME PAUSED" string when you pause the game with P or ESC keys;
- Fixed some graphic elements;
- Fixed Settings menu;
- Minor bug fixed

Enjoy!

Changelog:

- Fixed some issues with Bigballs enemies;
- Ladders in levels 3 and 4 have been adjusted;
- Fixed an issue with "Continue" feature

Stay tuned for more updates!
